Song Title: O Breath of life
Artist / Author:
Writers: Elizabeth Ann Porter Head & Trevor Hodge
Release year:
CCLI song #: 5439290
Order: Verse 1, Chorus, Chorus, Verse 2, Verse 3

Verse 1
O Breath of life, come sweeping through us,
Revive Your church with life and power.
O Breath of life, come, cleanse, renew us,
And fit Your church to meet this hour.

Chorus
O Breath of love, come breathe within,
Renewing thought and will and heart;
Come, Love of Christ, afresh to win,
Revive Your church in every part.

Chorus
O Breath of love, come breathe within,
Renewing thought and will and heart;
Come, Love of Christ, afresh to win,
Revive Your church in every part.

Verse 2
O Wind of God, come bend us, break us,
Till humbly we confess our need;
Then in Your tenderness remake us,
Revive, restore, for this we plead.

Verse 3
Revive us, Lord! Is zeal abating
while harvest fields are vast and ripe?
Revive us, Lord, the world is waiting,
Equip Your church to spread the light.
